INSERT INTO feature VALUES('atom-identity','identity','Identity at a sealed type','identity-by-recursion','partial','unique','dependent provers','A sealed type''s type member names its identity, @[ identity((relation, reflexivity, law)) ]: a reflexive relation whose singletons contract onto reflexivity is the type''s identity, so the relation''s evidence is a path at the atom and based path induction runs over it, computing along that evidence in a family reading neither entry, and in a family of identities at the atom, or of identities of them, whose relation returns the code of the unit type or of an identity of it outright, returning the unit; a relation returning the paths between its points is lawful by the same law; an interface naming no law refuses that evidence as AtomTransport.','surface-lowering core-checker core-nbe kernel-core','corpus/model/identity/atom-identity.gandr corpus/pathological/identity/atom-identity.gandr','corpus/ledger/features/atom-identity.gandr','#2053');
